{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ABC Magic Sparks 是一款專為幼兒而設的早期學習遊戲，透過色彩繽紛的關卡與互動活動，讓孩子在遊戲中輕鬆接觸字母與基礎認知，適合想為學前兒童準備啟蒙內容的家長。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線字母啟蒙互動關卡</h2>\n<p>App 設有 198 個學習關卡及 12 種互動活動，以清晰畫面與大型按鍵帶領幼兒認識 A 至 Z 字母，透過描畫及拖曳配對學習，並收集星星、引導字母蛇前進，亦可探索顏色、數字、形狀、水果與動物。主要活動支援離線，口語練習需麥克風及語音辨識權限，其他活動不受影響。程式不含帳戶、廣告與內購，進度只留在裝置內。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-123-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-124-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-125-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-126-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-127-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ABC Magic Sparks</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T02:18:53.958234+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T02:03:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T21:17:37.396611+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"44fafe708593a0fa73c32cda61c82c8bbcb4681574cf0cb070989b443a8a91cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}